WEBVTT

00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:02.953
Made it? Missed it? One tap.

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:07.626
Made the lift? Tap Made. The next set loads and your rest starts.

00:00:08.067 --> 00:00:13.175
Rate the effort, six easy to ten all out. Nine or ten holds your weight.

00:00:13.633 --> 00:00:18.834
Missed it? Tap Miss. Tag what went wrong, or dismiss it.

00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:22.876
Download Lifting Lab. No account. Free to start.
